<title>USA: Eco Soil names Gloff president/COO.</title>
<headline>Eco Soil names Gloff president/COO.</headline>
<dateline>RANCHO BERNARDO, Calif. 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eco Soil Systems Inc said on Wednesday it named Douglas Gloff president and chief operating officer.</p>
<p>Gloff replaces Jeffrey Johnson, who was named president and general manager of Eco Soil's golf division.</p>
<p>Eco Soil distributes biotech products for the soil and water-quality management markets. Its shares were trading down 1/8 to 5-1/4 at midday Wednesday.</p>
